# Welcome Adama Doumbouya

This is a warm welcome to an incredibly talented artist that has joined us here at Rhythm Culture. Master drummer, Adama and his wife Lisa are not only beautiful people but an absolute joy to work with.  Adama has now begun running workshops with Nathaniel and has joined our performance team. Adama's skill and knowledge of West African Rhythm is invaluable to us here and we are so happy to have some one of his calibre joining our team of performers. Adama tours with Mother Africa 6 months of the year but when he is at home with his lovely wife in Brisbane, he is also sharing music with us! Yay! Welcome Adama and we look forward to drumming with you lots more!
